<h1>Little Inkers for <%= kind === 'ios' ? 'iPhone' : 'Android' %></h1>
<p class="muted">The free coloring app for kids — 30+ pages, new packs every Monday. 100% free.</p>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Coming early November!</h2>
  <p>The Little Inkers app is almost here — free download for <%= kind === 'ios' ? 'iPhone' : 'Android' %> lands in early November.</p>
  <p class="muted">Check back soon — the download button will appear right here the moment it's ready.</p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem;">
  <h2>Watch the app in action</h2>
  <div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;">
    <iframe style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vn60dfEaPac" title="Little Inkers — free coloring app for kids" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">New episodes and coloring pages every week on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@littleinkersapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">our YouTube channel</a>. Don't forget to hit that subscribe button so you never miss an episode</p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF7E8,#FFE9C7);border-color:#ffd166;text-align:center;">
  <h2><%= t('li_sideload.sub.title') %></h2>
  <p><%= t('li_sideload.sub.text') %></p>
  <p><a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@littleinkersapp?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🔔 <%= t('li_sideload.sub.btn') %></a></p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:1rem;">
  <h2>Parents, quick notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No accounts for kids. No chat, no uploads from the app.</li>
    <li>Ads are kid-safe and never track your child.</li>
    <li>New free coloring packs land every Monday.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
